  "reason": "RNA multiprofile with avgpool (config_002) improved validation accuracy and F1 over singleprofile PCA (config_001), suggesting multiprofile aggregation is promising, but it is unclear whether transformer aggregation is better than avgpool. config_003 changes only aggregation from avgpool to transformer while keeping rna_only, multiprofile, and pca_n2000 fixed, directly isolating the aggregation effect. Under the limited budget, this is a logical exploitation of the current best setting and will clarify whether added aggregation complexity is worthwhile before testing other encoders or multimodal fusion."
